"Adamantine Bar,""WDH"",""90"",""none"",""Trade Good"","""","""","""","""",""10 lb."",""1.000 GP"",""Most wealth is not in coins. It is measured in livestock, grain, land, rights to collect taxes, or rights to resources (such as a mine or a forest).";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
