"Amethyst Lodestone,""FTD"",""22"",""very rare"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""This fist-sized chunk of amethyst is infused with an amethyst dragon's ability to bend gravitational forces. While you are carrying the lodestone, you have advantage on Strength saving throws.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
