"Astromancy Archive,""TCE"",""120"",""rare"",""Wondrous Item, Spellcasting Focus"",""Requires Attunement By a Wizard"","""","""","""",""3 lb."","""",""This brass disc of articulated, concentric rings unfolds into an armillary sphere. As a bonus action, you can unfold it into the sphere or back into a disc. When found, it contains the following spells, which are wizard spells for you while you are attuned to it: augury, divination, find the path, foresight, locate creature, and locate object. It functions as a spellbook for you, with spells encoded on the rings.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
