"Blasted Goggles,""BMT"",""174"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""These tinker's goggles have 3 charges. As an action, you can expend 1 charge to shoot a beam of fiery light from the goggles at a creature you can see within 120 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a DC 15 Dexterity saving throw or take 3d6 fire damage. The goggles regain 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
