"Boros Keyrune,""GGR"",""177"",""rare"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement By a Member of the Boros Guild"","""","""","""","""","""",""Carved from red sandstone with white granite elements to resemble a member of the Boros Legion, this keyrune can become a veteran (human) for up to 8 hours. In addition to fighting on your behalf, this veteran cheerfully offers tactical advice, which is usually sound. Anyone who talks with the transformed keyrune or examines it closely can easily recognize that it is an artificial human.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
