"Candle of Invocation,""DMG'24"",""241"",""very rare"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""This candle's magic is activated when the candle is lit, which requires a Magic action. After burning for 4 hours, the candle is destroyed. You can snuff it out early for use at a later time. Deduct the time it burned in increments of 1 minute from its total burn time.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
