"Canoe,""ToA"",""31"",""none"",""Vehicle (Water)"","""",""Speed: 2 mphCarrying Capacity: 6 passengersCrew 1, AC 11, HP 50"","""","""",""100 lb."",""50 GP"",""A canoe can be purchased in Port Nyanzaru for 50 gp. It holds up to six Medium creatures and has a maximum speed of 2 mph. It is otherwise identical to a rowboat.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
