"Clockwork Dog,""SKT"",""44"",""unknown (magic)"",""Other"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""This Tiny clockwork dog made of copper and tin comes with a copper wind-up key. As an action, you can use the key to wind the dog, after which it follows you for 12 hours. At the end of that duration, the clockwork dog stops until wound again. The dog has AC 5, 1 hit point, and a walking speed of 30 feet.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Clothes of Mending,""DMG'24"",""245"",""common"",""Wondrous Item"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""This elegant outfit magically mends itself to counteract daily wear and tear. Pieces of the outfit that are destroyed can't be repaired in this way.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
