"Crystalline Chronicle,""TCE"",""124"",""very rare"",""Wondrous Item, Spellcasting Focus"",""Requires Attunement By a Wizard"","""","""","""",""3 lb."","""",""An etched crystal sphere the size of a grapefruit hums faintly and pulses with irregular flares of inner light. While you are touching the crystal, you can retrieve and store information and spells within the crystal at the same rate as reading and writing. When found, the crystal contains the following spells: detect thoughts, intellect fortress, Rary's telepathic bond, sending, telekinesis, Tasha's mind whip, and Tenser's floating disk. It functions as a spellbook for you, with its spells and other writing psychically encoded within it.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
