"Elven Thrower,""BGG"",""64"",""very rare"",""Weapon (Spear), Simple Weapon, Melee Weapon"",""Requires Attunement By a Elf"",""1d6 Piercing"",""thrown (20/60 ft.), versatile (1d8)"","""",""3 lb."","""",""You gain a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. It has the thrown property with a normal range of 20 feet and a long range of 60 feet. When you hit with a ranged attack using this weapon, it deals an extra 1d8 damage or, if the target is a Giant, 2d8 damage. Immediately after the attack, the weapon flies back to your hand.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
