"Finder's Goggles,""ERLW"",""277"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement By a Creature with the Mark of Finding"","""","""","""","""","""",""The lenses of these garish goggles are carved from Siberys dragonshards. While wearing these lenses, you gain the following benefits:";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
