"Goggles of Object Reading,""EGW"",""267"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""These leather-framed goggles feature purple crystal lenses. While wearing the goggles, you have advantage on Intelligence (Arcana) checks made to reveal information about a creature or object you can see.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
