"Green Chromatic Rose,""WBtW"",""208"",""rare"",""Wondrous Item"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""While this rose is held, it issues green gas as a harmless visual effect.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
