"Harper Pin,""FRAiF"",""244"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""When you attune to this pin, choose a Harper persona (see the Forgotten Realms: Heroes of Faerûn for examples), including an alignment and a creature type. While wearing this pin, you register as that persona when targeted by magic to determine your creature type, alignment, or location.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
