"Illuminator's Tattoo,""TCE"",""129"",""common"",""Wondrous Item (Tattoo)"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""Produced by a special needle, this magic tattoo features beautiful calligraphy, images of writing implements, and the like.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
