"Lorehold Primer,""SCC"",""39"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement By a Spellcaster"","""","""","""","""","""",""The Lorehold Primer is a magic textbook created at Strixhaven's Lorehold College. The primer has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. If you make an Intelligence (History) or Intelligence (Religion) check while holding the primer, you can expend 1 charge to give yourself 1d4 bonus to the check, immediately after you roll the d20.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
