"Luxon Beacon,""EGW"",""268"",""legendary"",""Wondrous Item"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""This dodecahedron of faintly glowing crystal is heavier than it appears. A set of handles are affixed to its sides, and it pulsates and thrums when touched.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
