"Map or Scroll Case,""PHB'24"",""224"",""none"",""Adventuring Gear"","""","""","""","""",""1 lb."",""1 GP"",""A Map or Scroll Case holds up to 10 sheets of paper or 5 sheets of parchment.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Mariner's Armor,""DMG'24"",""278"",""uncommon"",""Generic Variant"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""While wearing this armor, you have a Swim Speed equal to your Speed. In addition, if you start your turn underwater with 0 Hit Points, you immediately regain 1d4 Hit Points. The armor can't heal anyone again until the next dawn.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
The armor is decorated with fish and shell motifs.;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
Base items. This item variant can be applied to the following base items:;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
