"Mimir,""SatO"",""13"",""rare"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""",""5 lb."","""",""This skull-shaped device is filled with knowledge. The device weighs 5 pounds and is covered with subtle etchings of planar sigils.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
