;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Your Wisdom score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score.You gain darkvision out to a range of 60 feet. If you already have darkvision, the orb increases its range by 60 feet.You have advantage on Wisdom checks to find hidden doors and paths. Curse. The orb is cursed, and becoming attuned to it extends the curse to you. As long as you remain cursed, you are unwilling to part with the orb, keeping it on your person at all times. All nonmagical flames within 30 feet of you automatically extinguish, and fire damage dealt by you is halved.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Orc Stone,""IDRotF"",""264"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement By a Recipient Only"","""","""","""","""","""",""I saved the life of an orc, who gave me a stone with the symbol of the Many-Arrows tribe (a humanoid skull pierced by three arrows) carved into it. The stone is an uncommon magic item that requires attunement, and only I can attune to it.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
As an action, I can use the stone to summon the spirit of an orc warrior, which appears within 30 feet of me. The spirit uses the orc war chief stat block in the Monster Manual and disappears after 10 minutes or when reduced to 0 hit points. The spirit understands any language I speak and obeys my commands.;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
