"Orcus Figurine,""CM"",""44"",""unknown (magic)"",""Wondrous Item"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""Carved from an ogre's petrified heart, the gray figurine depicts the Demon Prince of Undeath in ghastly detail, clutching his skull-topped wand in one hand and three severed heads by the hair in the other. The figurine smells like decaying flesh, and this scent is detectable out to a range of 5 feet.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
