"Plate of Knight's Fellowship,""BMT"",""37"",""uncommon"",""Heavy Armor (Plate Armor)"",""Requires Attunement"",""AC 18"","""","""",""65 lb."","""",""This gleaming set of silver-and-gold plate armor never tarnishes.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
