"Poison Absorbing Tattoo,""TCE"",""119"",""very rare"",""Wondrous Item (Tattoo)"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""Produced by a special needle, this magic tattoo features designs that emphasize one color (violet).";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
