"Potion of Aqueous Form,""MOT"",""197"",""rare"",""Potion"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""When you drink this potion, you transform into a pool of water. You return to your true form after 10 minutes or if you are incapacitated or die.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
