"Potion of Fire Breath,""DMG'24"",""187"",""uncommon"",""Potion"","""","""","""","""",""½ lb."","""",""After drinking this potion, you can take a Bonus Action to exhale fire at a target within 30 feet of yourself. The target makes a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw, taking 4d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. The effect ends after you exhale the fire three times or when 1 hour has passed.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
