"Potion of Possibility,""EGW"",""268"",""very rare"",""Potion"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""When you drink this clear potion, you gain two Fragments of Possibility, each of which looks like a Tiny, grayish bead of energy that follows you around, staying within 1 foot of you at all times. Each fragment lasts for 8 hours or until used.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
