"Quandrix Trinket,""SCC"",""33"",""none"",""Adventuring Gear"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""When you make your character, you may roll once on the Quandrix Trinkets table, instead of on the Trinkets table in the Player's Handbook, for your starting trinket.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
