"Quarterstaff,""PHB'24"",""215"",""none"",""Weapon, Simple Weapon, Melee Weapon"","""",""1d6 Bludgeoning"",""Versatile (1d8)"",""Mastery: Topple"",""4 lb."",""2 SP"",""Versatile. A Versatile weapon can be used with one or two hands. A damage value in parentheses appears with the property. The weapon deals that damage when used with two hands to make a melee attack.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
