"Reaper's Scream,""BGG"",""115"",""legendary"",""Weapon (Morningstar), Martial Weapon, Melee Weapon"",""Requires Attunement"",""1d8 Piercing"","""","""",""4 lb."","""",""The spikes of this iron morningstar glow with sickly, pale light. The death rune is inscribed on its shaft and inlaid with pearl.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
