"Once the rune has been invoked, it can't be invoked again until the next dawn.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Red Chromatic Rose,""WBtW"",""208"",""rare"",""Wondrous Item"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""While this rose is held, it is wreathed in fire as a harmless visual effect.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
