"Silver Sword,""MTF"",""89"",""unknown (magic)"",""Weapon, Martial Weapon, Melee Weapon"",""Requires Attunement By a Creature That Has Psionic Ability"",""2d6 Slashing"",""heavy, two‑handed"","""",""6 lb."","""",""You have a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon. On a critical hit against a target in an astral body (as with the astral projection spell), you can cut the silvery cord that tethers the target to its material body, instead of dealing damage.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
