"Two-Handed. This weapon requires two hands to use. This property is relevant only when you attack with the weapon, not when you simply hold it.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"Silvered Ammunition,""PHB'14"",""148"",""unknown"",""Ammunition, Generic Variant"","""","""","""","""","""","""",""Some monsters that have immunity or resistance to nonmagical weapons are susceptible to silver ammunition, so cautious adventurers invest extra coin to plate their ammunition in silver. You can silver ten pieces of ammunition for 100 gp. This cost represents not only the price of the silver, but the time and expertise needed to add silver to the ammunition without making it less effective.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
