"Slumbering Scaled Ornament,""FTD"",""27"",""uncommon"",""Wondrous Item"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""This ornament can be jewelry, a cloak, or another wearable accessory. It appears to be fashioned from a dragon's scale, tooth, or claw, or it incorporates images in those shapes.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
"You have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid being charmed or frightened or to end those conditions on you.""";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
