"Sword of the Planes,""BMT"",""68"",""legendary"",""Generic Variant"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""","""","""",""You gain a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic sword.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
