"Wand of Winter,""HotDQ"",""94"",""rare"",""Wand"",""Requires Attunement"","""","""","""",""1 lb."","""",""This wand looks and feels like an icicle. You must be attuned to the wand to use it.";;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;
