"Animal Shapes,""PHB'14"",""212"",""8th"",""Action"",""Concentration, up to 24 hours"",""Transmutation"",""30 feet"",""V, S"",""Druid (PHB'14)"","""","""",""Your magic turns others into beasts. Choose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. You transform each target into the form of a Large or smaller beast with a challenge rating of 4 or lower. On subsequent turns, you can use your action to transform affected creatures into new forms.";;;;;;;
