;;;;;;;
"The target's gear melds into the new form. The target can't activate, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment."",""""";;;;;;;
"Animal Shapes,""PHB'24"",""240"",""8th"",""Action"",""24 hours"",""Transmutation"",""30 feet"",""V, S"",""Druid (PHB'24)"","""","""",""Choose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. Each target shape-shifts into a Large or smaller Beast of your choice that has a Challenge Rating of 4 or lower. You can choose a different form for each target. On later turns, you can take a Magic action to transform the targets again.";;;;;;;
