"Armor of Agathys,""PHB'14"",""215"",""1st"",""Action"",""1 hour"",""Abjuration"",""Self"",""V, S, M (a cup of water)"",""Warlock (PHB'14)"","""",""Conquest (XGE) Paladin, Conquest (XGE) Paladin"",""A protective magical force surrounds you, manifesting as a spectral frost that covers you and your gear. You gain 5 temporary hit points for the duration. If a creature hits you with a melee attack while you have these hit points, the creature takes 5 cold damage."",""At Higher Levels. When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, both the temporary hit points and the cold damage increase by 5 for each slot level above 1st.""";;;;;;;
