"Shape Water,""XGE"",""164"",""Cantrip"",""Action"",""Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)"",""Transmutation"",""30 feet"",""S"","""",""Druid (PHB'14), Druid (PHB'24), Sorcerer (PHB'14), Sorcerer (PHB'24), Wizard (PHB'14), Wizard (PHB'24)"",""Arcana (SCAG) Cleric, Arcana (SCAG) Cleric, Arcane Trickster (PHB'24) Rogue, Arcane Trickster (PHB'14) Rogue, Chronurgy (EGW) Wizard, Chronurgy (EGW) Wizard, Land (PHB'14) Druid, Lore (PHB'24) Bard, Moon (FRHoF) Bard, Eldritch Knight (PHB'24) Fighter, Eldritch Knight (PHB'14) Fighter, Graviturgy (EGW) Wizard, Graviturgy (EGW) Wizard, Nature (PHB'14) Cleric, Nature (PHB'14) Cleric, Strength (PSA) (PSA) Cleric, Strength (PSA) (PSA) Cleric"",""You choose an area of water that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You manipulate it in one of the following ways:";;;;;;;
