"Spirit Guardians,""PHB'14"",""278"",""3rd"",""Action"",""Concentration, up to 10 minutes"",""Conjuration"",""Self"",""V, S, M (a holy symbol)"",""Cleric (PHB'14)"","""",""Lore (PHB'24) Bard, Divine Soul (XGE) Sorcerer, Divine Soul (XGE) Sorcerer, Crown (SCAG) Paladin, Crown (SCAG) Paladin, War (PHB'14) Cleric"",""You call forth spirits to protect you. They flit around you to a distance of 15 feet for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spectral form appears angelic or fey (your choice). If you are evil, they appear fiendish.";;;;;;;
