"Tiny Servant,""XGE"",""168"",""3rd"",""1 Min."",""8 hours"",""Transmutation"",""Touch"",""V, S"","""",""Artificer (TCE), Artificer (EFA), Wizard (PHB'14), Wizard (PHB'24)"",""Arcane Trickster (PHB'24) Rogue, Arcane Trickster (PHB'14) Rogue, Lore (PHB'24) Bard, Eldritch Knight (PHB'24) Fighter, Eldritch Knight (PHB'14) Fighter"",""You touch one Tiny, nonmagical object that isn't attached to another object or a surface and isn't being carried by another creature. The target animates and sprouts little arms and legs, becoming a creature under your control until the spell ends or the creature drops to 0 hit points. See the stat block for its statistics.";;;;;;;
